# The schema freshness test compares bytes, not structures. Any line-ending translation
# on checkout makes a checked-in schema differ from its own regeneration, which would
# fail CI on a Windows runner (GitHub's windows-latest sets core.autocrlf=true) while
# passing locally. Forcing LF everywhere makes the byte comparison mean what it says.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
